# ============================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages _redirects  —  old Wix URL  ->  new page   (301 = permanent)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pre-filled from the live Wix sitemap (same domain: www.christinacarpenter.org).
# A 301 passes most of the old page's ranking to the new one. Single hop, no chains.
# Deploy this file with the site; test a few of these after cutover.
# ============================================================================

# ---- Main pages ------------------------------------------------------------
/bloom-and-blossom-conference           /bloom-and-blossom.html   301
/authentic-joy-in-the-journey           /                         301
/book-online                            /#spaces                  301
/groups                                 /                         301
/challenges                             /                         301

# ---- Conference event pages (all past + current events) --------------------
# Splat catches every /event-details-registration/... URL in one rule.
/event-details-registration/*           /bloom-and-blossom.html   301

# ---- Booking / coaching service pages --------------------------------------
/service-page/coaching-session          /#spaces                  301
/service-page/extended-coaching-session /#spaces                  301
/service-page/initial-consultation      /#spaces                  301
/service-page/workshop-or-speaker       /#spaces                  301
/service-page/*                         /#spaces                  301

# ---- Old online programs / challenge pages (2022, low traffic) -------------
/challenge-page/*                       /                         301

# ---- Wix system paths ------------------------------------------------------
/book-online/*                          /#spaces                  301

# ============================================================================
# NOTE - www vs apex: _redirects matches the PATH only, not the hostname.
# Your canonical is https://www.christinacarpenter.org, so if you keep both
# hosts, add a Cloudflare Redirect Rule (Rules -> Redirect Rules) 301-ing the
# bare christinacarpenter.org -> www.christinacarpenter.org (or the reverse,
# if you'd rather drop the www - tell me and I'll flip the canonicals to match).
# ============================================================================
